Native inference adaptations for WanGP

U2NET: xuebinqin/U-2-Net, model/u2net.py (Apache-2.0).
https://github.com/xuebinqin/U-2-Net
Inference returns the primary logits; deprecated interpolation calls replaced;
abort checks added. LICENSE_U2NET accompanies the code.

BiRefNet General: ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet (MIT), Hugging Face revision
e2bf8e4460fc8fa32bba5ea4d94b3233d367b0e4.
https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet
Inference-only Swin-L / multiscale / deformable ASPP implementation. Training
heads removed; separate q/k/v projections use WanGP shared attention and MMGP.
LICENSE_BIREFNET and LICENSE_SWIN accompany the implementation.

Bria RMBG-2.0 uses the same BiRefNet architecture with Bria's trained weights:
https://huggingface.co/briaai/RMBG-2.0
Weights are CC BY-NC 4.0, not covered by BiRefNet's MIT code license.
Commercial use requires a separate agreement with Bria.

Alpha matting follows Daniel Gatis's rembg MIT implementation (v2.0.65):
https://github.com/danielgatis/rembg
LICENSE_REMBG accompanies the implementation. ONNX inference is not used.
